      "version": "2021-04-15",
      "summary": "Update Agent",
      "description": "Update Agent Updates a specific agent version by versionId. Supports updating nodes, edges, variables, and configuration. [PATCH /agent-studio/agent/versions/{versionId}] Token: location. Scopes: agent-studio.write.",
